## Directory Structure
<!-- cs: Adresářová struktura -->

```
doc/project-progress/
├── GLOSSARY.md
├── brief.md
├── spec.md
├── roadmap.md
└── epic-010-name/
    ├── plan.md
    ├── report.md
    └── task-010-name/
        ├── spec.md         # Task Specification + Context Bundle
        ├── dod.md          # Definition of Done checklist
        └── report.md       # Task Report
```

Numbering in steps of 10 — insertion: `epic-015-name/` between `epic-010` and `epic-020`.
<!-- cs: Číslování po 10 — vkládání: epic-015-name/ mezi epic-010 a epic-020. -->

## File Header (YAML front matter)
<!-- cs: Záhlaví souboru (YAML front matter) -->

Every APM document **must** start with this front matter:
<!-- cs: Každý APM dokument musí začínat tímto front matter: -->

```yaml
---
apm_category: task-spec         # see Document Types table above
apm_ref: E010.T020              # E010 = epic ref; E010.T020 = task ref
apm_level: task                 # project | epic | task
created_by: Planner             # Planner | Coder | Human
model: claude-opus-4-7          # model used; omit if Human
intended_for: Coder             # Planner | Coder | Human | All
created_at: 2026-05-08
updated_at: 2026-05-08
---
```

## Task Specification — required sections
<!-- cs: Task Specification — povinné sekce -->

1. **Goal** — what to build (1–3 sentences)
2. **Inputs** — files to read, APIs to call, data provided
3. **Outputs** — files to create/modify, interfaces to expose
4. **Context Bundle** — relevant existing files; files NOT to modify; interfaces from prior Tasks
5. **Dependencies** — which Tasks must be completed first
6. **Test Specification** — what tests to write; happy path + edge cases
7. **Definition of Done** — checklist (→ also written to `dod.md`)
8. **Recommended Coder model** — default: Composer-2; complex tasks: stronger model

## Coder — Task Report
<!-- cs: Coder — Task Report -->

Write `task-NNN/report.md` prose in `<communication-language>` (see `00-communication-language.mdc`). This section defines structure in **English**; rendered `##`/`###` headings must follow the mapping table when `<lang-code>` ≠ `en`.
<!-- cs: Prostý text reportu piš v <communication-language>. Tato sekce je anglicky; nadpisy v reportu musí odpovídat tabulce mapping pro cs (ne en). -->

### Required content (ordered `##` sections)
<!-- cs: Povinný obsah (pořadí sekcí ##) -->

| # | Section (English) | Czech (`cs`) `##` heading in `report.md` |
|---|-------------------|-------------------------------------------|
| 1 | What was implemented | `## Co bylo implementováno` |
| 2 | Inputs and outputs | `## Vstupy a výstupy` |
| 3 | Methods and decisions | `## Použité metody a rozhodnutí` |
| 4 | Code references | `## Reference do kódu` |
| 5 | Regression test results | `## Výsledek regresního testu` |
| 6 | Definition of Done | `## Definition of Done` |

When `<lang-code>` = `en`, use the English phrase as the `##` heading (e.g. `## What was implemented`). Optional follow-ups: extra `##` (e.g. *Notes*) only if needed; title in `<communication-language>`.
<!-- cs: Pro `en` použij anglický název z prvního sloupce tabulky jako `##` nadpis. Volitelné `##` (např. poznámky) jen pokud dává smysl; titulek v <communication-language>. -->

1. **What was implemented** — short summary (bullets preferred).
2. **Inputs and outputs** — read / created / changed / not touched lists.
3. **Methods and decisions** — key architecture and implementation choices.
4. **Code references** — files, notable symbols, line ranges.
5. **Regression test results** — ✅ all pass / ❌ failures, commands, exit codes, counts.
6. **Definition of Done** — short summary + link to `dod.md` (do not duplicate the full checklist).

### Mandatory Markdown layout (task `report.md`)
<!-- cs: Povinné Markdown rozložení (task report.md) -->

- Between top-level `##` sections, optional `---` **only** if it improves scanability (avoid spamming rules).
  <!-- cs: Mezi sekcemi ## volitelně --- jen pro čitelnost. -->

- **What was implemented:** use bullets; avoid one continuous paragraph longer than ~4 sentences.
  <!-- cs: Co bylo implementováno: odrážky; žádný mega-odstavec. -->

- **Inputs and outputs:** use `###` subsections; **one repo path per bullet**, always in backticks. For `cs`: `### Přečteno`, `### Vytvořeno`, `### Změněno`, `### Nedotčeno (Context Bundle)`. For `en`: `### Read`, `### Created`, `### Changed`, `### Not modified (Context Bundle)`.
  <!-- cs: Vstupy/výstupy: podsekce ###; jedna cesta na řádek v backticks. -->

- **Methods and decisions:** split themes: either separate `### Topic` blocks or bullets with a **bold** lead-in line followed by a short paragraph; do not merge unrelated topics in one bullet.
  <!-- cs: Metody: odděl témata (### nebo tučný úvod); neslučuj nesouvisející body. -->

- **Code references:** include a **Markdown table**: `| File | Lines | Summary |` (lines = range such as `1-42`). Put function/class names in Summary when useful.
  <!-- cs: Reference: tabulka Soubor | Řádky | Shrnutí. -->

- **Regression test results:** use a **table** (`| Command / scope | Result | Notes |`) or clearly structured bullets with command, outcome, and exit code (state **0 tests** / pytest exit **5** when applicable).
  <!-- cs: Regrese: tabulka nebo jasné odrážky včetně exit kódů. -->

- **Definition of Done:** one short paragraph + `[dod.md](dod.md)` link.
  <!-- cs: DoD: krátce + odkaz na dod.md. -->

❌ One bullet with comma-separated paths for “created” files.  
✅ One path per line under `### Created` / `### Vytvořeno`.

## Security guard
<!-- cs: Bezpečnostní zábrany -->

- No `git commit/push` without explicit Human approval.
  <!-- cs: Žádný git commit/push bez explicitního souhlasu člověka. -->
- No database migrations without Human approval.
  <!-- cs: Žádné DB migrace bez souhlasu člověka. -->
- No destructive file operations without confirmation.
  <!-- cs: Žádné destruktivní operace se soubory bez potvrzení. -->
